      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Chih-Min Chao",
        "email": "chihmin.chao@sifive.com",
        "date": "2026-03-03T08:33:43Z"
      },
      "message": "Fix major opcode mismatches (OP-32 to OP-IMM-32)\n\nFix encoding mismatches for scalar shift and add instructions where\nthe specification incorrectly used OP-32 (0111011) instead of\nOP-IMM-32 (0011011) opcode.\n\nAffected instructions:\n- PSLL.BS: Change opcode from 0111011 to 0011011\n- PSLL.HS: Change opcode from 0111011 to 0011011\n- PADD.HS: Change opcode from 0111011 to 0011011\n- PSSHA.HS: Change opcode from 0111011 to 0011011\n- PADD.WS (RV64): Change opcode from 0111011 to 0011011\n\nSigned-off-by: Chih-Min Chao <chihmin.chao@sifive.com>",
      "tree": {
