        "date": "2026-03-03T08:35:04Z"
      },
      "message": "Fix PREDSUM.BS and PREDSUMU.BS encoding format\n\nFix reduction sum byte instructions to match implementation:\n- Change format from 4-bit f (30..27) to 3-bit f (30..28) + bit 27\n- Change opcode from OP-32 (0111011) to OP-IMM-32 (0011011)\n- Change funct3 from 001 to 100\n\nAffected instructions:\n- PREDSUM.BS\n- PREDSUMU.BS\n\nSigned-off-by: Chih-Min Chao <chihmin.chao@sifive.com>",
