  {
    "sha": "fc377e54a0e6e5398f0cabbadaed96be819f4859",
    "node_id": "C_kwDORcVfkdoAKGZjMzc3ZTU0YTBlNmU1Mzk4ZjBjYWJiYWRhZWQ5NmJlODE5ZjQ4NTk",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Chih-Min Chao",
        "email": "chihmin.chao@sifive.com",
        "date": "2026-03-02T10:09:44Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Chih-Min Chao",
        "email": "chihmin.chao@sifive.com",
        "date": "2026-03-03T08:35:04Z"
      },
      "message": "Fix PM2ADD/PM4ADD family encodings\n\nFix multiply-add instruction family encodings to match implementation:\n\nRV32/RV64 base (funct3: 110->101, w: 10->00):\n- PM2ADD.H, PM2ADDA.H\n- PM2ADD.HX, PM2ADDA.HX\n- PM2ADDU.H, PM2ADDAU.H\n- PM2ADDSU.H, PM2ADDASU.H\n\nPM4ADD.B family (funct3: 100->101, w: 11->10):\n- PM4ADD.B, PM4ADDSU.B, PM4ADDU.B\n\nPM2SUBA family (f field change, funct3: 110->101, w: 11->00):\n- PM2SUBA.H: f 0101->1001\n- PM2SUBA.HX: f 0111->1011\n\nRV64 PM2ADD.W family (funct3: 111->101, w: 10->01):\n- PM2ADD.W, PM2ADDSU.W, PM2ADDASU.W, PM2ADDU.W\n- PM2ADD.WX, PM2ADDA.WX\n- PM2SUBA.W: f 0101->1001\n- PM2SUBA.WX: f 0111->1011\n\nSigned-off-by: Chih-Min Chao <chihmin.chao@sifive.com>",
