        "date": "2026-03-03T08:35:57Z"
      },
      "message": "Fix comparison instruction encodings\n\nFix mask comparison instruction encodings to match implementation:\n- Change column header from 30..28 to 30..27 (4-bit f field)\n- Change w field from 10 to 01\n\nAffected instructions:\n- MSEQ (RV32/RV64)\n- MSLT (RV32/RV64)\n- MSLTU (RV32/RV64)\n- PMSEQ.W (RV64)\n- PMSLT.W (RV64)\n- PMSLTU.W (RV64)\n\nSigned-off-by: Chih-Min Chao <chihmin.chao@sifive.com>",
      "tree": {
