        "date": "2026-03-03T08:35:57Z"
      },
      "message": "Fix PMULH byte selection instruction encodings\n\nFix packed multiply-high with byte selection instruction encodings\nto match implementation:\n\nPMULH.H.B0: f 1000->0100, funct3 001->111\nPMULH.H.B1: f 1000->0110, funct3 011->111\nPMULHSU.H.B0: f 1100->0100, w 00->10, funct3 001->111\nPMULHSU.H.B1: f 1100->0110, w 00->10, funct3 011->111\nPMHACC.H.B0: f 1001->0101, funct3 001->111\nPMHACC.H.B1: f 1001->0111, funct3 011->111\nPMHACCSU.H.B0: f 1101->0101, w 00->10, funct3 001->111\nPMHACCSU.H.B1: f 1101->0111, w 00->10, funct3 011->111\n\nSigned-off-by: Chih-Min Chao <chihmin.chao@sifive.com>",
